{"video":"JJW1ZNOKGqo","lines":[{"t":[0,3.7],"en":"Okay, ladies, I will be in my office for one to seven hours"},{"t":[3.7,5.3],"en":"for my weekly chat with Ann."},{"t":[5.3,6.7],"en":"I brought some fresh snacks,"},{"t":[6.8,9.3],"en":"and I made a backup plan for the vendor chart"},{"t":[9.3,11],"en":"in case, you know, yours isn't good."},{"t":[11.4,12.8],"en":"Actually, Ann called while you were in the bathroom."},{"t":[13.2,15],"en":"She said something came up. She called you later."},{"t":[15.1,16.1],"en":"I don't know. I told her to leave your voicemail."},{"t":[16.2,17.9],"en":"Oh, God, why'd you let me say all that?"},{"t":[18.1,19.7],"en":"I'm coming in, voicemail. I'm coming!"},{"t":[20.4,22.2],"en":"Listen to me very carefully."},{"t":[22.3,23.9],"en":"I have not been taken."},{"t":[24.3,26.3],"en":"I know that's always your first fear when I'm not available,"},{"t":[26.3,29.1],"en":"but this is not a Liam Neeson taken scenario."},{"t":[29.1,30.4],"en":"That's exactly what they'd make you say."},{"t":[30.4,32.3],"en":"Also, no one's making me say this."},{"t":[32.4,35.9],"en":"I am a free woman, untaken, simply going about my business."},{"t":[36,37.6],"en":"I just have to run. Something came up."},{"t":[37.8,38.9],"en":"I love you, and I'll call you later."},{"t":[40.7,43],"en":"Donna? What's good, baby?"},{"t":[43.4,45.3],"en":"What's going down in Donatown?"},{"t":[45.8,47.4],"en":"What's the haps in Migglewood?"},{"t":[47.9,49.5],"en":"I'm listening to Jaleel or No Deal."},{"t":[49.8,51.3],"en":"It's a podcast where the kid who played Urkel"},{"t":[51.3,53.1],"en":"reviews old Deal or No Deal episodes."},{"t":[53.5,54.6],"en":"It's pointless, and I love it."},{"t":[54.6,55.7],"en":"Okay, don't let me interrupt."},{"t":[56.1,57.8],"en":"April, what's the 411, little mama?"},{"t":[57.9,59.9],"en":"What's the hot goss? Who you crushing on these days?"},{"t":[59.9,61.6],"en":"Ew, my husband, weirdo."},{"t":[62.1,63.8],"en":"Can I get back to work now? Thanks. Bye."},{"t":[64.9,67.8],"en":"Work? You can work whenever, except for now."},{"t":[68.1,70.5],"en":"Because now is lady time."},{"t":[70.6,71.9],"en":"You sound like a tampon commercial."},{"t":[72.2,74.5],"en":"I'm setting up an impromptu Galentine's Day."},{"t":[75,75.4],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[75.6,75.9],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[76.2,78.4],"en":"Wait, I thought you weren't going to do Galentine's Day this year"},{"t":[78.4,80.3],"en":"because that she-beast moved away."},{"t":[80.5,82.6],"en":"I believe her name was Satan."},{"t":[82.9,84.7],"en":"Her name is Anne, and she is gone,"},{"t":[84.8,85.9],"en":"and I have accepted it,"},{"t":[86,87.5],"en":"and we are going to have Galentine's Day."},{"t":[87.8,88.4],"en":"Ladies up front."},{"t":[89.3,91.1],"en":"I need an Anne who lives in Pawnee,"},{"t":[91.2,93.1],"en":"and there is no one obvious candidate,"},{"t":[93.3,95],"en":"so I will test them out"},{"t":[95,97.6],"en":"on the ultimate battlefield of female friendship,"},{"t":[98.4,99.6],"en":"Galentine's Day brunch."},{"t":[99.8,102.7],"en":"It will be a women's-only marathon bonding session"},{"t":[102.7,103.8],"en":"with tons of whipped cream."},{"t":[104.6,106.7],"en":"Side note, do not Google that phrase."},{"t":[108,109.6],"en":"Shauna, I'm so glad you could make it."},{"t":[109.7,110.5],"en":"You're so tan."},{"t":[110.7,111.3],"en":"Oh, thanks."},{"t":[111.5,113.5],"en":"I just got back from a solo trip to Rome."},{"t":[113.8,115],"en":"I was going to go with my boyfriend,"},{"t":[115.3,116.2],"en":"but he couldn't come"},{"t":[116.2,118.9],"en":"because he decided to stay with his wife."},{"t":[119.2,119.5],"en":"Oof."},{"t":[120.1,121.1],"en":"I love Rome."},{"t":[121.4,122.9],"en":"It's such a great place."},{"t":[123.1,123.8],"en":"Rome's played out."},{"t":[124.4,125.7],"en":"Have y'all been to Kuala Lumpur?"},{"t":[126.1,127.4],"en":"When did you go to Asia?"},{"t":[127.5,128.4],"en":"I go all the time."},{"t":[128.5,130],"en":"Where do you think I got that Crystal Buddha head"},{"t":[130,130.8],"en":"above my jacuzzi?"},{"t":[131,131.7],"en":"You have a jacuzzi?"},{"t":[131.9,132.4],"en":"Good to know."},{"t":[133.1,134.9],"en":"Prospects for new Pawnee best friend."},{"t":[135.2,137],"en":"Donna Meagle, confident, worldly,"},{"t":[137.2,138],"en":"we go way back."},{"t":[138.1,139.7],"en":"April Ludgate, vivid imagination,"},{"t":[140,140.8],"en":"young and vibrant."},{"t":[141.3,143],"en":"Shauna Mulway-Tweeb, pretty, fragile,"},{"t":[143.2,144.2],"en":"makes terrible life decisions,"},{"t":[144.3,145.1],"en":"a real fixer-upper,"},{"t":[145.2,147.2],"en":"but look, it's not like Anne was doing so hot"},{"t":[147.2,147.7],"en":"when I met her."},{"t":[148.1,149.7],"en":"Ethel Biebers, bit of a dark horse,"},{"t":[149.8,151.3],"en":"crotchety, but probably wise."},{"t":[151.8,152.9],"en":"And then we got Evelyn,"},{"t":[153.3,154.3],"en":"a.k.a. fake Anne."},{"t":[154.7,155.5],"en":"I don't know her last name."},{"t":[155.6,156.7],"en":"Honestly, we just needed bodies."},{"t":[157.2,158.7],"en":"Thank you everyone for getting together"},{"t":[158.7,159.6],"en":"on such short notice"},{"t":[159.6,161.3],"en":"and happy Galentine's Day."},{"t":[161.9,163.6],"en":"Now this is not technically"},{"t":[163.6,164.6],"en":"the right date,"},{"t":[164.7,166.1],"en":"but any time a group of women"},{"t":[166.1,167],"en":"get together for brunch,"},{"t":[167.4,169.2],"en":"we embody the spirit of the holiday."},{"t":[169.7,171.1],"en":"Today we will celebrate friendship,"},{"t":[171.4,172.5],"en":"spend a few hours together,"},{"t":[172.6,174.1],"en":"and answer a couple of questions"},{"t":[174.1,174.7],"en":"I've compiled."},{"t":[175.1,176.6],"en":"Just for fun, nothing serious."},{"t":[176.9,177.9],"en":"But please answer them"},{"t":[177.9,178.7],"en":"with complete honesty"},{"t":[178.7,179.5],"en":"because I'll be able to tell"},{"t":[179.5,180],"en":"if you're lying."},{"t":[180.3,180.9],"en":"To girlfriends!"},{"t":[181.4,181.8],"en":"Yay!"},{"t":[181.8,184.4],"en":"Okay, it's time"},{"t":[184.4,186.5],"en":"for a little Galentine's Day Q&A."},{"t":[186.8,187.8],"en":"Donna, you pick first."},{"t":[189.2,191.2],"en":"What is your favorite TV show?"},{"t":[192.4,193.5],"en":"Well, for live tweeting,"},{"t":[193.8,194.3],"en":"it's scandal."},{"t":[194.7,196.2],"en":"For binge watching,"},{"t":[196.5,197.1],"en":"it's scandal."},{"t":[197.4,198.3],"en":"But for fashion,"},{"t":[198.8,199.7],"en":"it's actually scandal."},{"t":[199.9,200.7],"en":"My answer is scandal."},{"t":[201.1,201.4],"en":"Hmm."},{"t":[201.7,202],"en":"April?"},{"t":[202.5,204.5],"en":"Ooh, I love watching"},{"t":[204.5,205.9],"en":"Russian traffic accidents"},{"t":[205.9,206.6],"en":"on YouTube"},{"t":[206.6,208.5],"en":"while I play children's music"},{"t":[208.5,209.3],"en":"at the wrong RPM."},{"t":[209.7,210.8],"en":"I like beauty pageants."},{"t":[211.1,213.3],"en":"Everyone is so happy and perfect."},{"t":[213.6,216],"en":"I like diagnosis murder"},{"t":[216,218],"en":"and skin flicks."},{"t":[218.3,220.2],"en":"Can anybody top me off?"},{"t":[220.4,221.3],"en":"The correct answer"},{"t":[221.3,222.6],"en":"for favorite TV show"},{"t":[222.6,224.3],"en":"is Friday Night Lights."},{"t":[224.5,225.5],"en":"The correct answer?"},{"t":[225.7,226.4],"en":"Next question."},{"t":[228.3,229.1],"en":"Lady's choice."},{"t":[229.3,230.4],"en":"Ooh, wild card option."},{"t":[230.5,231.3],"en":"Okay, anybody reveal"},{"t":[231.3,232.1],"en":"anything about their life,"},{"t":[232.1,232.7],"en":"anything at all?"},{"t":[232.8,233.8],"en":"I've gotten two annulments."},{"t":[234.7,235.9],"en":"One for pleasure"},{"t":[235.9,238.2],"en":"and one to cap off a long con."},{"t":[238.2,239.6],"en":"I was running against Keith Sweat."},{"t":[239.7,240.2],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[240.5,241.2],"en":"Ethel, have you..."},{"t":[241.2,242.2],"en":"Okay, Ethel's asleep."},{"t":[242.8,243.1],"en":"Shana?"},{"t":[243.4,244.5],"en":"I'm writing a memoir"},{"t":[244.5,245.6],"en":"based on my blog."},{"t":[245.8,246.2],"en":"It's called"},{"t":[246.2,247.4],"en":"Tweeping Up Appearances"},{"t":[247.4,248.9],"en":"and it's about my journey"},{"t":[248.9,250],"en":"to find happiness"},{"t":[250,251.9],"en":"by smiling through the pain."},{"t":[252.1,253.4],"en":"Okay, I can work with that."},{"t":[253.9,254.2],"en":"No."},{"t":[254.5,255.2],"en":"What you got going on"},{"t":[255.2,255.6],"en":"in that notebook?"},{"t":[256,257.6],"en":"Just jotting down memories"},{"t":[257.6,258.9],"en":"in my trusty old journal."},{"t":[260.2,261.2],"en":"Friendship rankings."},{"t":[261.8,262.3],"en":"What's that?"},{"t":[262.4,263.8],"en":"It's not what it sounds like."},{"t":[263.8,264.7],"en":"It's simply a way for me"},{"t":[264.7,265.2],"en":"to figure out"},{"t":[265.2,265.7],"en":"which one of you"},{"t":[265.7,267],"en":"is the best."},{"t":[268.2,269.1],"en":"That's messed up."},{"t":[269.2,270.6],"en":"Yeah, that is really lame"},{"t":[270.6,271.5],"en":"and I'm leaving."},{"t":[271.9,272.8],"en":"You're better than that note."},{"t":[272.9,274.2],"en":"Donna, why are you angry?"},{"t":[274.3,275.2],"en":"You were in first place."},{"t":[275.3,275.9],"en":"Bye, everyone."},{"t":[276.3,278.3],"en":"This was a really..."},{"t":[278.3,280.6],"en":"...brunch."},{"t":[281,281.5],"en":"Leave the bag."},{"t":[282,284.1],"en":"If you do this again next year,"},{"t":[284.2,285.8],"en":"don't call me."},{"t":[287,288.1],"en":"Well, by default,"},{"t":[288.2,288.8],"en":"it's Shana."},{"t":[289.2,290.1],"en":"That's how you want to find"},{"t":[290.1,291.1],"en":"your new best friend, right?"},{"t":[291.4,292],"en":"By default?"},{"t":[292,293],"en":"I'll see you next week."},{"t":[293,293.1],"en":"Bye."}]}
